abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for a staged colorectal-cancer transcriptomic
  study using six development cohorts, three locked external validation
  cohorts, and orthogonal methylation and proteomic validation. The archive
  preserves analysis locks, scripts, frozen model artifacts, derived results,
  execution manifests, audit reports, and cryptographic hashes.
